  "native_contract": {
    "aura_reset": "Fresh player descriptor writes zero to48 aura IDs47..94 and6 flag words95..100 before unroot/relocation/speed. Ordinary new-Game effects publish afterward.",
    "mover_reset": "Old serialN selects unrootN+10, spawn relocationN+11, unconditional fresh cached speedN+12, and successor serialN+13, all wrappingu32. Constructor packets remain queued afterward.",
    "limits": "Native allocator/BTree/zone/packet seams are explicit. Reconstructed bootstrap previously masked a lasting speed carry locally but did not implement this packet/serial boundary; no observed original-game defect, compilation, runtime or parity claim."
  },
